  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_002 (multimodal, multiprofile, scgpt RNA, resnet50 image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves 0.494 validation accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 (a simpler, linear method) affects performance, isolating the impact of RNA representation choices. It directly compares a complex (scgpt) vs. simpler (pca) encoder under identical other settings, helping determine if RNA encoding complexity is critical. This addresses uncertainty about the optimal RNA encoder while maintaining consistency in other design choices."
